      hu: "Nagy magassagu teruletek Xela kornyeken gyumolcsosokkal es huvos hegyi levegovel.",
      ro: "Zone inalte in regiunea Xela, cu livezi si aer montan racoros.",
      en: "High-elevation land around Xela with orchards and cool mountain air."
